{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_kanban_boards_flow_board_window", "label": "Flow board window context (kind: window)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A rolling stretch of calendar days (14/30/90, 30 default) with no working-day list, so eight figures stop measuring a team against a boundary it never agreed to. A fixed set because two boards are comparable only if asked the same question. kind is sent by both transports, never inferred from the id."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_refuse_in_place_or_not_shown", "label": "Refuse in place versus not shown", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A tile refuses in place when the condition can lift; it is not shown when it has no subject on this board and never will (burndown, commitment history, team load). Nothing dropped without being named in the context bar and the tile picker."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_flow_health", "label": "Flow health composite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same machine as sprint health (drop-and-name, re-weighting, half-weight floor) over flow efficiency 40%, blockers 30%, ageing 30%. Flow efficiency is load-bearing: without started it refuses outright rather than scoring hygiene as health."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_status_transitions", "label": "statusTransitions sent raw by the resolver", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The resolver sends raw status transitions and the page decides what they mean under the config it holds, rather than computing started in a third implementation nobody can test against a tenant. Not capped: a truncated list would silently move a start date later."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_flow_tiles", "label": "The four flow tiles", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cycle time, ageing WIP, weekly throughput, cumulative flow. Shown by default only on a flow board, offered on any. CFD has three bands from status categories and says so; Little's Law is reconciled with no verdict drawn."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_team_slice_dedup", "label": "team_slice de-duplicates issues by key", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A flow board's three windows hold the same issues, so every issue was in the slice three times and the 85th percentile came back two and a half times too early. A plausible wrong number, not a failure."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_window_no_default_target", "label": "A window supplies no default forecast target", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A window's endDate is today; passed as the default target, 'will this land in time' answered 0% about a deadline nobody set."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_next_commitment_invented_sprint_length", "label": "next_commitment's invented ten-day sprint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "forecast.build passes 'or 10', so a dataset with no sprint dates got a commitment sized against a sprint nobody chose and recommend_commitment's correct refusal was unreachable."}, {"id": "docs_kanban_boards_health_score_refuses_on_flow_board", "label": "Sprint health refuses whole on a flow board", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pace (0.34) and scope stability (0.22) both need the clock; dropped, blockers and ageing hold 0.44, below the half-weight floor. What is left is hygiene, not whether anything lands."}, {"id": "agent_tools_selection_team_slice", "label": "selection.team_slice()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agent_tools_forecast_build", "label": "forecast.build()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agent_tools_forecast_recommend_commitment", "label": "forecast.recommend_commitment()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agent_tools_metrics", "label": "agent/tools/metrics.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_kanban_boards_flow_board_window", "target": "docs_kanban_boards_refuse_in_place_or_not_shown", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/kanban-boards.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_kanban_boards_flow_health", "target": "docs_kanban_boards_status_transitions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/kanban-board